        "name": "",
        "type": "message",
        "message": "<div style=\"padding:12px 16px;background:#f0f6ff;border-left:4px solid #1e3a5f;border-radius:6px;line-height:1.5\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px\"><strong>Follow the tabs in order — they match the website layout.</strong></p><ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:#333\"><li><strong>Hero</strong> — left side headline + buttons</li><li><strong>Sample Card</strong> — right side example card</li><li><strong>Statistics</strong> — 104 / 70% / min wage row</li><li><strong>Calculator Form</strong> — every form field (incl. industries), one under another</li><li><strong>Pay Rules</strong> — % that drive the maths (Year 1 / Year 2)</li><li><strong>Your Entitlement</strong> — live blue result card + policy button</li><li><strong>How It Works</strong> — bottom steps</li><li><strong>How We Calculate</strong> — the transparency / FAQ section below the calculator</li></ol><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;color:#555\">Edit → click <strong>Update</strong> → refresh the website. No developer needed.</p></div>"
      },

